	"data": "Pixelorama\n\n2D pixel art editor built in Godot.\nRepo: <https://github.com/Orama-Interactive/Pixelorama>\nLicense: Check repo\nGodot version: 4.x\nStatus: Active, full-featured, listed in awesome-godot\n\nWhat It Provides\nFull 2D pixel art editor running inside Godot\nDrawing tools, layers, animation, palette\nProves you can build a complete editor application in Godot\n\nRelevance\nLess directly relevant to spatial authoring, but proves the pattern: Godot can host a full-featured editor application, not…",
